================================================================================
3. DATA
================================================================================

No exchange data is redistributed in this repository. All inputs are retrieved
at run time from free, public archives of the National Stock Exchange of India
and the Taiwan Futures Exchange, and are subject to those exchanges' own terms.
Retrieval URLs, timestamps and SHA-256 hashes are recorded in DATA_LOG.md and
data/manifest.jsonl; `make check` re-verifies every hash.
